{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About <i>Pachi-Pachi Typing</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pachi-Pachi Typing</i> is a game that combines the short-ST (Special Time) experience of pachinko with the score-attack style of a typing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By winning the lottery draw, players enter either \u201cLive Bonus\u201d or \u201cSpecial Live Bonus\u201d mode, during which they can type to earn points.<br>The duration of each bonus mode differs, and when the timer expires, another lottery draw begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through this cycle, players aim for high scores based on both luck and skill.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cf Typing Words</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game mainly features terminology from <strong>pachinko and slot machines</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Words you've fully typed will be added to your <strong>Dictionary</strong>, where you'll be able to read explanations \u2014 this feature is planned for future implementation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters, etc.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters such as <strong>Tsukasa Sasaoka</strong> and <strong>Himeka Sakura</strong> appear, shared with other <i>Honwaka-Fuwafuwa</i> titles like <i>Replay Bell Suika Slot-Like Game</i>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4106900?t=1761715346","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4106900?t=1761715346","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106900/dd858a1b555b6c91b0af8b6bdc1aef1cc02f5007/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761715346","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106900/dd858a1b555b6c91b0af8b6bdc1aef1cc02f5007/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761715346","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About <i>Pachi-Pachi Typing</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pachi-Pachi Typing</i> is a game that combines the short-ST (Special Time) experience of pachinko with the score-attack style of a typing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By winning the lottery draw, players enter either \u201cLive Bonus\u201d or \u201cSpecial Live Bonus\u201d mode, during which they can type to earn points.<br>The duration of each bonus mode differs, and when the timer expires, another lottery draw begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through this cycle, players aim for high scores based on both luck and skill.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cf Typing Words</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game mainly features terminology from <strong>pachinko and slot machines</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Words you've fully typed will be added to your <strong>Dictionary</strong>, where you'll be able to read explanations \u2014 this feature is planned for future implementation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters, etc.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters such as <strong>Tsukasa Sasaoka</strong> and <strong>Himeka Sakura</strong> appear, shared with other <i>Honwaka-Fuwafuwa</i> titles like <i>Replay Bell Suika Slot-Like Game</i>.</p>","developers":["\u307b\u3093\u308f\u304b\u3075\u308f\u3075\u308f"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106900/9ecffc784dd62458e6513ef4e906cab499a94e6c/header.jpg?t=1761715346","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4106900/1274670434/678a31c8ab5ca5182eef326e0dc628846bc06d7e/1761661971/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761663639","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4106900/1274670434/678a31c8ab5ca5